ilestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/60","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/milestone/60","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/60/labels","id":5197171,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNTE5NzE3MQ==","number":60,"title":"1.3.1.Final","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":184,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-03-13T05:49:08Z","updated_at":"2020-06-25T11:42:03Z","due_on":"2020-03-27T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2020-03-28T16:35:22Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2020-03-25T15:47:41Z","updated_at":"2020-03-26T12:09:41Z","closed_at":"2020-03-26T11:11:40Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"For Qute templates, there seems to be inconsistent behaviour when it comes to having whitespace before and after braces `{`,`}`.\r\n\r\n### Case 1 (whitespaces before closing brace for the starting tag)\r\n```\r\n<body>\r\n    <h1>{#if 10 > 5    }Hello{/if}</h1>\r\n</body>\r\n```\r\nIn this case, everything works as expected:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20326645/77548301-be8ef600-6e84-11ea-9abe-59072d99b9b8.png)\r\n\r\n### Case 2 (whitespaces before closing brace for the ending tag)\r\n```\r\n<body>\r\n    <h1>{#if 10 > 5}Hello{/if }</h1>\r\n</body>\r\n```\r\nIn this case, this error appears:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20326645/77551461-bfc22200-6e88-11ea-82ba-5088e781df77.png)\r\n\r\n### Case 3 (whitespaces after opening brace)\r\n```\r\n<body>\r\n    <p>Hello { name ?: \"world\"}!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n```\r\nIn this case, there is no error, but the output is unexpected:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20326645/77551860-32cb9880-6e89-11ea-9eec-1dc620710088.png)\r\n\r\n### Case 4 (whitespaces before closing brace)\r\n```\r\n<body>\r\n    <p>Hello {name ?: \"world\" }!</p>\r\n</body>\r\n```\r\nIn this case, there is no error, but the output is unexpected:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20326645/77551942-4d9e0d00-6e89-11ea-946f-55bbb3a6eec4.png)\r\n\r\nTo conclude, in some cases (like case 1) having whitespace causes nothing unexpected to happen but in other cases, having whitespaces cause inconsistent behaviour.\r\n\r\nFor example, if case 3 is expected behaviour, I think it is unexpected to have case 4 output \"NOT_FOUND\"","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/u